; Logo MIDI command reference
; Load this file in the VST editor and press Run, or use the CLI renderer.
; Durations are quarter-note beats unless noted.

TEMPO 120
CHANNEL 1
VELOCITY 96
GATE 0.8
PROGRAM 0
CC 1 32

; NOTE pitch duration
NOTE 60 0.5
NOTE 62 0.5
NOTE (60 + RANDOM 12) 0.5

; STEAL beats lengthens the previous NOTE or CHORD.
; ANTICIPATE beats moves the next NOTE or CHORD onset earlier.
NOTE 64 1
STEAL 0.15
ANTICIPATE 0.1
NOTE 65 1

; CHORD [pitch pitch ...] duration
CHORD [60 64 67] 1

; REST duration (in beats); WAIT ticks (60 ticks = 1 second)
REST 0.5
WAIT 30

; TEMPO changes the internal playback tempo from this point onward.
TEMPO 90
NOTE 67 1
